{"4106790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ACCURSED", "steam_appid": 4106790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cults gather at midnight in the forests of Midnight Falls, working to awaken their master. As a recruit of <strong>ACCURSED INC.</strong>, you’re a charismatic investigator armed with special abilities for exactly this kind of nightmare. Ghouls prowl the mountain, ghosts and almost-human shapes haunt the streets, and someone keeps knocking on your apartment door every night at exactly 3:33 A.M.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106790/extras/5d22519cffc82ed5afb2e492bbe09f14.avif?t=1772328644\" width=994 height=1017 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>100+ horrifying enemies</strong>, collect <strong>100+ mysterious items</strong>, and survive <strong>100+ suspenseful events</strong>, ensuring every run feels unique. Which items truly synergize? Which option is best in a given event? What secrets open only if you’re carrying the right relic? It’s up to you to uncover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106790/extras/ce43508947b8b5cd36188e39e447250c.avif?t=1772328644\" width=990 height=1016 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will represent ACCURSED INC.? Choose from <strong>10 playable characters</strong>, each with unique powers and stats, and carve your own path through the coming awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106790/extras/1ae96f40c4959d9d5220647e412aa5d9.avif?t=1772328644\" width=128 height=192 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams